  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced onion and cook until it is translucent and starting to caramelize.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly to prevent burning.",
    "Add the petit pois, cumin, coriander, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for 3-4 minutes, or until the petit pois are tender but still crisp.",
    "Stir in the lemon juice and cook for an additional 1-2 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Transfer the stir-fry to a serving dish and garnish with chopped fresh parsley, if desired.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
